      "content": "but there are no spaces like that. i've looked. everywhere i go, i'm just the weird one or the one that doesn't get it. it feels like i'm just dragging this heavy, useless version of myself through a life that wasn't even meant for me. i'm just so done with the struggle. it feels pointless.",
